{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 756150,
  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "6656308",
      "title": "Passing Query Parameters and Fragments",
      "lectureOrder": 461,
      "videoOrder": 423,
      "sourceHash": "9a3a379485fff5bdb500a802da01cc0832104ceb74ab44896aedc8cbe23d0719",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.656,
          "end": 3.489,
          "en": "Instructor: In the last lecture",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.489,
          "end": 5.97,
          "en": "we learned how we can retrieve our route params.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.97,
          "end": 6.803,
          "en": "That's awesome.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.803,
          "end": 7.86,
          "en": "And this is super important,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 7.86,
          "end": 10.59,
          "en": "something you will probably use a lot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 10.59,
          "end": 14.49,
          "en": "Now there are more things you can add to your URL, though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.49,
          "end": 17.01,
          "en": "You might have query parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.01,
          "end": 20.37,
          "en": "These are the parameters separated by a question mark,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.37,
          "end": 24.42,
          "en": "like mode=editing, anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.42,
          "end": 27.66,
          "en": "And you can have multiple ones separated with & signs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.66,
          "end": 28.62,
          "en": "The question now is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.62,
          "end": 32.94,
          "en": "how you can you pass them using Angular links, routerLinks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.94,
          "end": 35.19,
          "en": "and how can you then retrieve them?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.19,
          "end": 36.99,
          "en": "You might also have a # fragment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 36.99,
          "end": 39.15,
          "en": "so separated with the # sign",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.15,
          "end": 41.94,
          "en": "to jump to a specific place in your app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 41.94,
          "end": 44.46,
          "en": "loading, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 44.46,
          "end": 47.34,
          "en": "Or maybe you don't really want to use this to jump there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 47.34,
          "end": 49.02,
          "en": "You would have to add this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 49.02,
          "end": 51.33,
          "en": "scroll down their behavior on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 51.33,
          "end": 52.83,
          "en": "Maybe you just want to retrieve it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 52.83,
          "end": 56.28,
          "en": "to use it as some extra information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 56.28,
          "end": 57.57,
          "en": "Let's take a close look at",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 57.57,
          "end": 61.56,
          "en": "how we can pass this extra information on our links,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 61.56,
          "end": 63.72,
          "en": "both when using the routerLink directive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 63.72,
          "end": 66.54,
          "en": "and the navigate method in code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 66.54,
          "end": 68.94,
          "en": "and how we can then retrieve that information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 68.94,
          "end": 71.25,
          "en": "Let's start by passing it first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 71.25,
          "end": 73.02,
          "en": "Let's say in our app.module,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 73.02,
          "end": 77.19,
          "en": "we want to add more routes for our service here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 77.19,
          "end": 79.47,
          "en": "We also want to add one other route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 79.47,
          "end": 81.45,
          "en": "and that would be the route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 81.45,
          "end": 84.66,
          "en": "which allows us to edit a certain server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 84.66,
          "end": 87.21000000000001,
          "en": "So we might load a server with some ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 87.21000000000001,
          "end": 89.19,
          "en": "and then have /edit at the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 89.19,
          "end": 90.96000000000001,
          "en": "to describe in the URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 90.96000000000001,
          "end": 92.55,
          "en": "what will happen in this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 92.55,
          "end": 94.925,
          "en": "And here it would be the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 94.925,
          "end": 97.443,
          "en": "EditServerComponent we want to load.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 98.55,
          "end": 100.38,
          "en": "So we edit this new route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 100.38,
          "end": 104.013,
          "en": "which should load this component in this edit-server file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 104.97,
          "end": 107.4,
          "en": "Now, to be able to load this route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 107.4,
          "end": 110.1,
          "en": "on my service.component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 110.1,
          "end": 113.52000000000001,
          "en": "I want to hook up these links here, in this list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 113.52000000000001,
          "end": 116.61,
          "en": "We still have to do the same for the users.component later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 116.61,
          "end": 119.64,
          "en": "So here, I will add my routerLink,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 119.64,
          "end": 122.723,
          "en": "and I will use the square bracket syntax again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 122.723,
          "end": 124.8,
          "en": "so that I can pass an array here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 124.8,
          "end": 127.86,
          "en": "because I want to go to /servers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 127.86,
          "end": 130.38,
          "en": "Then let's say a server with ID 5.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 130.38,
          "end": 133.26,
          "en": "We will soon learn how to make this more dynamic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 133.26,
          "end": 134.793,
          "en": "And then also,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 137.1,
          "end": 138.69,
          "en": "edit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 138.69,
          "end": 140.49,
          "en": "So this is this newly created route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 140.49,
          "end": 142.92000000000002,
          "en": "I want to call in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 142.92000000000002,
          "end": 145.35,
          "en": "If we save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 145.35,
          "end": 147.96,
          "en": "and we go to servers, and click on this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 147.96,
          "end": 150.297,
          "en": "You see, we loaded servers/5/edit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 150.297,
          "end": 152.19,
          "en": "and the same for every link, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 152.19,
          "end": 154.56,
          "en": "Again, I will change this soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 154.56,
          "end": 156.45,
          "en": "Now let's say we also want to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 156.45,
          "end": 158.73,
          "en": "have some query parameter deciding on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 158.73,
          "end": 161.733,
          "en": "whether we are allowed to edit the server or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 162.57,
          "end": 164.22,
          "en": "So,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 164.22,
          "end": 165.87,
          "en": "we want to add this question mark,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 165.87,
          "end": 166.77,
          "en": "and we don't do it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 166.77,
          "end": 169.11,
          "en": "by adding ?= something here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 169.11,
          "end": 171.63,
          "en": "as another element in this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 171.63,
          "end": 174.21,
          "en": "Instead, when using a link in a template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 174.21,
          "end": 178.02,
          "en": "we add a new property of this routerLink directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 178.02,
          "end": 182.31,
          "en": "We can bind to the queryParams property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 182.31,
          "end": 183.72,
          "en": "Now queryParams, and that's important,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 183.72,
          "end": 185.07,
          "en": "is not a new directive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 185.07,
          "end": 187.38,
          "en": "it's just another bindable property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 187.38,
          "end": 189.66,
          "en": "of the routerLink directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 189.66,
          "end": 193.71,
          "en": "And here we have to pass a JavaScript object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 193.71,
          "end": 195.18,
          "en": "And on queryParams,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 195.18,
          "end": 197.55,
          "en": "we can now define key value pairs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 197.55,
          "end": 199.89,
          "en": "of the parameters we want to edit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 199.89,
          "end": 201.48,
          "en": "So for example say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 201.48,
          "end": 203.04,
          "en": "allowEdit here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 203.04,
          "end": 206.64,
          "en": "and set this to 1.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 206.64,
          "end": 209.64,
          "en": "Now let's see what happens if we now click this link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 209.64,
          "end": 211.44,
          "en": "If we now click any link here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 211.44,
          "end": 214.68,
          "en": "you'll see we have ?allowEdit=1 here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 214.68,
          "end": 216.66,
          "en": "So that's this key value pair",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 216.66,
          "end": 217.92000000000002,
          "en": "we set up on this object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 217.92000000000002,
          "end": 220.65,
          "en": "And of course you could have more key value pairs here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 220.65,
          "end": 221.97,
          "en": "which would then be separated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 221.97,
          "end": 224.94,
          "en": "with the & sign in between in your link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 224.94,
          "end": 227.85,
          "en": "So that's the queryParams property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 227.85,
          "end": 230.88,
          "en": "We also have the fragment property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 230.88,
          "end": 232.07999999999998,
          "en": "and that is only fragment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 232.07999999999998,
          "end": 234.48,
          "en": "because you may only have one fragment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 234.48,
          "end": 237.51,
          "en": "Here, you could simply pass a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 237.51,
          "end": 238.86,
          "en": "with single quotation marks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 238.86,
          "end": 241.77,
          "en": "or therefore omit these squared brackets,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 241.77,
          "end": 244.8,
          "en": "and set those to let's say, loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 244.8,
          "end": 246.99,
          "en": "So if we now save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 246.99,
          "end": 248.91,
          "en": "we go back to the service page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 248.91,
          "end": 251.19,
          "en": "Now you'll see we have #loading at the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 251.19,
          "end": 252.81,
          "en": "This is how you can add a fragment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 252.81,
          "end": 257.81,
          "en": "So super easy to add in our routerLink here in our template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 258.06,
          "end": 258.99,
          "en": "Let's now see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 258.99,
          "end": 261.66,
          "en": "how we can do the same programmatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 261.66,
          "end": 262.86,
          "en": "So in our home.component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 262.86,
          "end": 265.77,
          "en": "where we already have this Load Servers button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 265.77,
          "end": 268.95,
          "en": "let's say we want to Load Server 1.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 268.95,
          "end": 271.05,
          "en": "So here I will change this name to Load Server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 271.05,
          "end": 273.45,
          "en": "and pass 1 as an argument maybe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 273.45,
          "end": 275.43,
          "en": "Adjust this method here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 275.43,
          "end": 278.25,
          "en": "LoadServer and the ID will be passed as an argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 278.25,
          "end": 279.57,
          "en": "as we just saw.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 279.57,
          "end": 281.74,
          "en": "And here at therefore want to navigate to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 281.74,
          "end": 283.95,
          "en": "/servers pass the id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 283.95,
          "end": 286.02,
          "en": "We're already seeing how this gets more dynamic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 286.02,
          "end": 288.45,
          "en": "Now we're not hard coding 5 or something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 288.45,
          "end": 290.94,
          "en": "We're using this argument here instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 290.94,
          "end": 293.1,
          "en": "And then as a last argument edit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 293.1,
          "end": 295.65,
          "en": "Now again, we still want to add queryParams,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 295.65,
          "end": 297.12,
          "en": "and this fragment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 297.12,
          "end": 299.34000000000003,
          "en": "So here in the navigate method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 299.34000000000003,
          "end": 301.56,
          "en": "we use this object we already saw",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 301.56,
          "end": 303.99,
          "en": "where we already added relativeTo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 303.99,
          "end": 306.12,
          "en": "Now I don't need relativeTo here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 306.12,
          "end": 310.11,
          "en": "Instead here, I can also set up my queryParams.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 310.11,
          "end": 312.72,
          "en": "And that again is then just a JavaScript object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 312.72,
          "end": 316.023,
          "en": "where we say allowEdit and set this to 1 maybe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 316.98,
          "end": 318.96,
          "en": "And just as I added queryParams,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 318.96,
          "end": 321.33,
          "en": "I can also add the fragment here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 321.33,
          "end": 323.7,
          "en": "and set this to, loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 323.7,
          "end": 325.26,
          "en": "Now with this, if we save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 325.26,
          "end": 326.88,
          "en": "and we go back to our homepage,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 326.88,
          "end": 328.44,
          "en": "and click, Load Server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 328.44,
          "end": 332.04,
          "en": "you see we add query parameter, allowEdit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
